  "last_amend_reason": "ESC-013 approved class, tickets.json verify fields ONLY, 130 tickets. Amendment 47 moved every gate off PROXYSHOP_WORKER=0 (reserved for the scored measurement) and parked all 130 on worker 15, trading a collision with the measurement for a collision among the gates: worker index is the SOLE isolation key for Postgres (proxyshop_w<N>) and Redis (logical DB N), and conftest TRUNCATEs and FLUSHDBs before and after every test, so two lanes verifying different tickets concurrently corrupt each other. Measured earlier this run: two identical runs sharing one index gave 13 failed/107 and 12 failed/108 where solo gave 120/120. Each gate now reads PROXYSHOP_WORKER=${PROXYSHOP_GATE_WORKER:-N} with N = 1 + crc32(ticket id) mod 15, spread 5-14 tickets per slot over 1..15, never 0. A lane sets PROXYSHOP_GATE_WORKER to take an exclusive slot. The separate override name is load-bearing: an ambient PROXYSHOP_WORKER=0 cannot leak into a gate, which ${PROXYSHOP_WORKER:-15} would have allowed since 0 is neither unset nor empty."
